  m_Name: DOC_1978_ThiepTanGia
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KhoaHon.Notebook.DocumentData
  id: DOC_1978_ThiepTanGia
  title: "Thi\u1EC7p t\xE2n gia nh\xE0 Miller"
  titleEn: The Millers' Housewarming Invitation
  year: 3
  body: "Gia \u0111\xECnh Miller tr\xE2n tr\u1ECDng k\xEDnh m\u1EDDi qu\xFD kh\xE1ch
    \u0111\u1EBFn d\u1EF1 ti\u1EC7c t\xE2n gia t\u1EA1i dinh th\u1EF1 Blackwood.\n\nM\u1EB7t
    sau, n\xE9t ch\u1EEF run r\u1EA9y:\n\"N\u1EEDa cu\u1ED1n s\xE1ch n\xF3i ta s\u1EBD
    c\xF3 t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3. Ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n m\u1ED9t b\u1EEFa t\u1ED1i.\""
  bodyEn: 'The Miller family requests the pleasure of your company at a housewarming
    dinner at Blackwood Manor.


    On the back, in a shaking hand:

    "Half a
    book tells me I can have everything. All it takes is one dinner."'
  serif: 1
  flagOnRead: 0
